# Exercise every observable stream: keyboard bytes, PS/2 packets, UART loopback,
# rate-window controls, and RTC polling after a deterministic clock jump.
at 0.2s caption top 3s IRQ RATES AND RAW DEVICE BYTES IN ONE LIVE DASHBOARD
at 10 key A down
at 12 key A up
at 16 key RIGHT down
at 18 key RIGHT up

at 0.5s mouse 18 -12 0
at 0.7s mouse -7 9 1
at 0.8s mouse 0 0 0

at 1s key SPACE down
at 1.1s key SPACE up
at 1.4s caption bottom 2s COUNTERS STAY LIVE WHILE RATE HISTORY IS FROZEN
at 1.8s key SPACE down
at 1.9s key SPACE up

at 2s rtc 2031-12-24T23:59:58
at 2.1s key L down
at 2.2s key L up
at 2.6s key L down
at 2.7s key L up
at 3s mouse 42 20 0

at 4.4s key ESC down
at 4.5s key ESC up
